": "1649951459463035", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623443_1649951462796368_6495437171366118499_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_SV34X-Gx3kQ7kNvwHEdMMV&_nc_oc=AdpaR4fD2GK4Ps3GtTNJNizAcrJzDaFmbcfkz17H-iYYFyk6KJQi8qeN5xK5JI3K_0A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTLwpuLgf3FNuRK6kndmI9d2nEmFFhk4m2MavW9qaDfFA&oe=6B0B0F48"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot3.png", "id": "796010373336947", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619672_796010376670280_1622690528672245878_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XsM0O1SdPYMQ7kNvwGepyQp&_nc_oc=AdrQLfvoKLiDGzNFr6GQtOIF42pgRjr8G9M8SKueNYuMWTTvAf8BM1ly6iT2h35ekAY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQffIFyA5lnVvIeXnYLtR8mFFWSQy38_Dw9vLNS3c59uw&oe=6B0B4288"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot4.png", "id": "900207153052082", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_900207156385415_3810073691747307333_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jJMwGjJEedIQ7kNvwGPhMyX&_nc_oc=AdqrCLb-rOx7VfANEuybmR8mQFjv5e7a98L7PaW6U24HSR8oONYNw8LKZrtoI19pdjU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTDFm9ygtjAvVYyeOpS9ZvDYgmt2y8ppSldXtl2bX787w&oe=6B0B21AF"}, {"file_name": "ScreenShot5.png", "id": "947398901258988", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622214_947398904592321_4765479034696321724_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7OC-4zPSdAMQ7kNvwHricv2&_nc_oc=Adru9eSsnY8QAMvSk5PmxNdP_I6tH_8mvdaPkR6ysf28utSKejayZ6qTgXN0ALqH3iI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQskulAX3PxEAtJXt1kF8kmKyfMrAau_yycPtrc9mbkVg&oe=6B0B427F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Snapshot_1.PNG", "id": "712382138600986", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618444_712382141934319_6039130477330376030_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V9dBrN-zx5cQ7kNvwFvwzHc&_nc_oc=AdquxstqjAnGySsPd8XM7yDc7wlL2PwiCSF2mNZL4THvl6lgnOSyjRkQb2N_9ynXZl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSrlIo17C2u435AkD5F0j0TY5gzYHzWvxvzGx6vPhWIPw&oe=6B0B41C5"}, "display_name": "The Abstract Art Gallery", "keywords": ["Abstract", "Art", "Gallery", "Neon", "Paintings"], "long_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944). He was one of the most important 20th-century artists. He was a major figure in modern art and painted some of the first modern abstract works.\n\nThe experience does not show the original paintings of Wassily Kandinsky, instead it presents a Neon-Futuristic version of each painting. You have a play button on each panting to see an AI Animation made with the Meta AI.\n\nThe exposition is divided in 6 sections (each section contains 10 paintings), and there is a transportation point to move from one section to another.\n\nKandinsky also developed a theory of geometric figures and their relationships, claiming (for example) that the circle is the most peaceful shape and represents the human soul.", "short_description": "The Abstract Art Gallery is a VR Experience that shows 60 paintings of the famous painter Wassily Kandinsky  (1866 \u2013 1944)."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/privacy-notice-last-updated-april-15_19.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Midi Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blogspot.com/p/who-are-we-indie-virtual-reality-video.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "4349619